TEXT -8 120 Left 2 ;For varicap tuning, voltage over C1 must be reduced.  That can be can by playing with\nvalues of C1 and C4, which are actually in series.  Decreasing C1 and raising C4\nwill reduce voltage over C4.  Don't overdo it because it will decrease spectral purity.
